Unibus/Omnibus Drivers, extended single
<UL>
<LI><b>M783B</b> needs a drawing.</LI>
<LI><b>M783bad</b> is a version of the M783 that won't work.</LI>
<LI><b>M783</b> is basically DEC's version of the M783 Bus Drivers module,
using the now hard to find DS8881.</LI>
<LI><b>M783new</b> is a version of DEC's M783 Bus Drivers module using the 
AM26S10 instead of the DS8881.</LI>
